      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990-EZ, Part III, Line 28</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>The purpose of Diospi Suyana is to provide funding to other international non-profit organizations to construct, operate, and run activities in the country of Peru primarily a hospital and other supporting facilities for the indigenous underpriveledge people of that country. Funds from this organization will also be used to support other international non-profit organizatons to help spread the gospel of Jesus Christ in the country of Peru. Diospi Suyana is organized and shall be operated exclusively for religious, medical, charitable, scientific, and educational purposes within the meaning of Secton 501c3 of the Internal Revenue Code of 1986 as amended or the corresponding provision of future tax laws. In furtherance, and only in furtherance, of these eneumerated purposes and subject to the limitations provided herin, the Corporation may engage in and lawful activity. The principle purpose of the Corporation will be to receive and administer funds for the aformentioned purposes.</ExplanationTxt>
